[[0,2110478,0,8,0,8,"2017-09-06T08:15:21","WhoaMan","",[],"<p>I haven't done one of these in a while</p>\n<p>So I was reviewing <a href=\"http://i.magaimg.net/img/1bxf.png\">some constructive criticism where somebody was trying to claim that &quot;they live&quot;</a> was not a metaphor for the Jewish conspiracy and he went on this challenge for someone to write a review on &quot;Jaws&quot; with &quot;the (((shark))).&quot; </p>\n<p>I'm going to need some time to work on it, but I'm always up for a challenge when it comes to analyzing works of art and how they are a metaphor for the Jewish conspiracy. I never let a question go unanswered without at least trying.</p>\n<p>Here's the <a href=\"http://i.magaimg.net/img/1bxg.png\">poster for my new movie</a> for the work in progress.</p>","Alt-Right movie review in progress; Jaws","","Identitarian"],[1,10404628,0,1,0,1,"2017-09-06T09:45:13","BigMatteson","",[],"<p>Aren't Roy Scheider, Lorraine Gary, Carl Gottlieb, and Speilberg all Jews? You need more echos.</p>"],[2,10404739,10404628,0,0,0,"2017-09-06T10:35:33","WhoaMan","",[],"<p>added for roy, others are too small</p>"],[3,10404831,10404739,1,0,1,"2017-09-06T11:09:36","BigMatteson","",[],"<p>Just echo the whole poster. I love Jaws but only because Quint is the quintessential American and he has some of the best lines ever written. I don't like how Spielberg, Gottlieb, and Benchley changed the book into the movie, though. The affair between Hooper and the Chief's wife was a big part of the book, and Hooper should've died, and Quint was supposed to be dragged down after getting tangled in his harpoon line. I guess they had to cut things to make it fit into 2 hours, but still.</p>"],[4,10413546,10404831,0,0,0,"2017-09-07T02:53:25","IAMA_WhiteMale_AMA","",[],"<p>If I ever captain a boat, I'm growing Quint sideburns and learning all those seafaring songs, like <a href=\"https://youtu.be/s0CvSIhF_tA\">Barrett's Privateers</a>.</p>"],[2,10407227,10404628,0,0,0,"2017-09-06T16:30:23","thealtright","",[],"<p>I've seen conflicting information on whether Roy Schieder was Jewish.</p>\n<p>His Wiki page says:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Scheider's mother was of Irish descent with an Irish Catholic background, while his father was a Protestant German American.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roy_Scheider\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roy_Scheider</a></p>\n<p>There's another website that mentions him being from Hungarian Jewish parents and being born in Budapest but it doesn't look very reliable.</p>\n<p>He also played (((Dustin Hoffman)))'s brother in <strong>Marathon Man</strong>, a very Jewish movie full of Holocaust propaganda and anti-German/anti-Nazi themes.</p>\n<p>I'm not sure if he was Jewish or not.</p>"],[1,10404640,0,2,0,2,"2017-09-06T09:51:08","MaunaLoona","",[],"<p>Look at that (((nose))).</p>"],[1,10412269,0,0,0,0,"2017-09-07T00:26:16","Dungeon_Cremaster","",[],"<p>Yeah, please do!</p>\n<p>Apart from the altrightish elements, it'd also be interesting if the movie holds up after so many years, or if it's unbearable to watch.</p>\n<p>Also, Jaws IS quintessentially jewish at least from a production standpoint, because it was pretty much the first aggressively constructed AAA-Blockbuster.</p>"]]
